disbursement, of compensation under Commonwealth, state and territory governments' compulsory access and acquisition legislation and policy;* > > *(d) identifying best practice approaches to the development and implementation of a fair national approach to compulsory access and acquisition consultation and compensation;* > > *(e) measures required to secure the rights of landowners, farmers and fishers to maintain and safeguard the continued productivity of agriculture and fisheries, including emergency management;* > > *(f) the efficacy of consultation processes between Indigenous landholders, farm","result":"negative","slug":"division-federal-senate-8461","source_url":"https://theyvoteforyou.org.au/divisions/senate/2023-11-14/5"}
